    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arkwright\u00a0 is an action platformer set in a dark 8-bit world.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The darkness is here! Turn off the light, the demons have arrived on Earth. Save the humankind.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >STORY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You played as Solene, a young warrior. You village has been attacked by monsters. Defeat them trought 6 levels, as an old cursed church, swamps, dark forest.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Retro 2d Action Platformer</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight with your sword and other secrets special weapons to save humankind</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face many enemies as undead villagers, evil crows, giant bats, skeletons, cultists, werewolfs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel across 6 unique lands, from the burned village of Ravendor to the sinister realms beyond the Dark forest.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique chiptune music composed for the game\u00a0, paying homage to the 8-bit console era! Soundtrack by Hans Vivian-Wenzel and Corentin\u00a0Guezenoc.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arkwright\u00a0 is an action platformer set in a dark 8-bit world.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The darkness is here! Turn off the light, the demons have arrived on Earth. Save the humankind.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >STORY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You played as Solene, a young warrior. You village has been attacked by monsters. Defeat them trought 6 levels, as an old cursed church, swamps, dark forest.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Retro 2d Action Platformer</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight with your sword and other secrets special weapons to save humankind</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face many enemies as undead villagers, evil crows, giant bats, skeletons, cultists, werewolfs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel across 6 unique lands, from the burned village of Ravendor to the sinister realms beyond the Dark forest.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique chiptune music composed for the game\u00a0, paying homage to the 8-bit console era! Soundtrack by Hans Vivian-Wenzel and Corentin\u00a0Guezenoc.</p></li></ul>",
